# Secrets. This repository is public: anything committed is published, and
# deleting it later does not take it back. Keep credentials in GitHub Actions
# secrets or in local files these patterns cover. CI runs gitleaks as well
# (.github/workflows/secret-scan.yml).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
key.properties
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*service-account*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
!.env.production
